1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,600
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:27,733
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

3
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,367
[JUNE] Look at this idiot.

4
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:32,033
He's thinking about basketball
instead of apologizing.

5
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:34,533
Tch. He's so annoying.

6
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:41,333
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

7
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:43,100
[YOUNG TOTO]
<i> You're amazing, Ping!</i>

8
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,300
[YOUNG PING]<i> It's because
</i> my teammate's the best!

9
00:00:49,033 --> 00:00:51,433
You look so handsome
when you smile.

10
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:55,133
If only you would
look at me like that.

11
00:00:57,633 --> 00:00:59,233
[PHONE CHIMES]

12
00:01:02,333 --> 00:01:04,367
[TOTO ON THE PHONE]
<i> Hello, Ping?</i>

13
00:01:04,367 --> 00:01:06,067
<i> I know you're looking for me.</i>

14
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,067
<i> I also know that your company</i>

15
00:01:14,067 --> 00:01:15,267
<i>is filing an estafa case
against me.</i>

16
00:01:15,267 --> 00:01:18,433
<i>But I only did it because
the people I owed money to</i>

17
00:01:18,433 --> 00:01:19,567
<i> were pressuring me.</i>

18
00:01:19,567 --> 00:01:23,367
<i>So, please, Ping,
withdraw the case against me.</i>

19
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,700
<i>I don't even know
where I'm safe anymore.</i>

20
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:27,067
<i> Please, Ping.</i>

21
00:01:27,067 --> 00:01:32,133
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC PLAYING]

22
00:01:32,133 --> 00:01:33,667
[PING] Why don't you ever learn?

23
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:37,667
<i>No matter what I do, you just
keep doing it again and again.</i>

24
00:01:37,667 --> 00:01:40,233
[PHONE RINGING]

25
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,100
[RINGING CONTINUES]

26
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:46,100
[PHONE BEEPS]

27
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:52,833
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

28
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,133
[TWIG CREAKS]

29
00:01:57,333 --> 00:01:58,433
Who's there?

30
00:02:00,867 --> 00:02:03,667
- [MOUSE SQUEAKING]
- [SCREAMING] Aah!

31
00:02:03,667 --> 00:02:05,367
It's a rat! Aah!

32
00:02:05,367 --> 00:02:06,800
Aah! It's a rat! Aah!

33
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,500
[PING]
What are you even doing here?

34
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:10,633
[SCREAMING] Aah!

35
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,467
Ow!

36
00:02:12,467 --> 00:02:14,400
Enough! I'm safe now!

37
00:02:14,433 --> 00:02:15,767
You're hurting me!

38
00:02:15,767 --> 00:02:17,533
- What were you doing here?
- That really hurt!

39
00:02:18,333 --> 00:02:19,467
You're spying on me, aren't you?

40
00:02:19,467 --> 00:02:21,767
[SILLY MUSIC PLAYING]

41
00:02:21,767 --> 00:02:22,867
Was that your brother?

42
